---
// src/pages/en/Engineering.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
	title="Audio Engineering | Javier Flores — Live Sound, Q-SYS & AoIP Systems"
	description="Audio engineering by Javier Flores: live sound, Q-SYS systems, Dante AoIP networks, recording, and mixing for global theater and cruise productions."
	lang="en"
	pathEs="ingenieria"
	pathEn="engineering"
>
	<!-- Main -->
		<div id="main" class="alt">
			<!-- One -->
				<section id="one">
					<div class="inner">
						<header class="major">
							<h1>Engineering and Audio</h1>
							<h2>Live Audio</h2>
						</header>
						<span class="image main"><img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Casa-de-la-Musica-de-Viena.webp`} alt="Javier Flores as FOH audio technician at the La Casa de la Música de Viena auditorium in Puebla" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
						<p>I have had two major jobs in live audio. The first one was at one of the museums of La Constancia Mexicana in Puebla, specifically at the "Vienna House of Music in Puebla" museum. There, my duties included museum maintenance, guiding tours, and—most importantly for me—working as the audio engineer in their 500-seat auditorium.</p>
						<p>My second live audio job is with the "Compañía Folklórica Magisterial de Hidalgo," where I am part of the musician team while also serving as the sound engineer on certain occasions. For international tours, I act as the liaison between the musicians, company directors, and the host country's audio engineers.</p>
					</div>
				</section>
		</div>
		<div id="main" class="alt">
			<!-- One -->
				<section id="one">
					<div class="inner">
						<header class="major">
							<h2>Recording and Mixing</h2>
						</header>
						<span class="image main"><img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-estudio-Tec-Puebla.webp`} alt="Javier Flores at the Tec de Monterrey Puebla recording studio during a mixing session" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
						<p>Studying Music Production Engineering has equipped me with skills such as miking techniques, analog and digital mixing, and many other audio-related disciplines.</p>
					</div>
				</section>
		</div>
</Layout>